            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A marker for burying adjacent an underground structure such that a location of the underground structure can be identified from above a ground surface. The marker comprises a housing, a gimbal beacon retention device disposed within the housing. The gimbal beacon retention device comprises an outer gimbal structure and an inner gimbal structure rotatable disposed within the outer gimbal structure and carrying the beacon device. The gimbal beacon retention device is structured and operable to orient the beacon device in a desired orientation relative to a ground surface regardless of the orientation of the housing relative to the ground surface.</p>
            </abstract>
